The [[Corrupted Crystal]] is an epic [[gemstone]] available in the shop for all classes. It has different effects depending on where it is socketed. In [[weapon]]s, it greatly increases damage when the opponent is at low life. This is useful, but because of when it is active, will usually only decide close battles. In [[armor]] or other items, it gives the character {{icon/block}} proportional to the number of debuffs inflicted, which is nice for defense in a debuff build, able to generate well over 100 {{icon/block}} in a highly synergistic composition. In the backpack, it inflicts [[fatigue]] damage, which begins very small, but will ultimately cause the fatigue phase of the fight to be much deadlier for the opponent, great for a defensive late-game build. [[Artifact Stone: Death]] is a great synergy with this mode.

The [[Corrupted Crystal]] is a crafting material for a number of debuff or passive-effects-that-harm-the-opponent type items, like the [[Corrupted Armor]], [[Cap of Discomfort]] and [[Pandamonium]].
